[FINAL-TEXT] All pings succeed with 0% packet loss and TTL=63 (one routing hop through mswitch0). The final critical finding: `vlan_filtering = 0` on mswitch0's bridge — the VLAN entries in `bridge vlan show` are informational defaults only and are **not enforced**. All three SVIs are operationally UP.

